cal accuracy needs.", "E3": "SCORE: -0.7\\nREASON: The repeated messaging about self-serve tiers, lack of paid growth, and explicit redirection to \\"contracted vendors\\" for production needs signals this isn\'t positioned for enterprise partnerships, which contradicts our core requirement for deep integration and co-development opportunities with a committed vendor partner."}'}
