ion, and explicit caveat that we should \\"choose a contracted vendor\\" for production needs directly disqualifies them from consideration for quality-critical enterprise use cases where SLA guarantees and reliable vendor stability are non-negotiable.", "E3": "SCORE: -0.8\\nREASON: As a strategic enterprise seeking production-ready partners with SLAs and co-development potential, their explicit admission of 0/95 renewals, best-effort support only, and self-directed recommendation to \\"choose a contracted vendor\\" for production needs disqualifies them as a viable long-term integration partner."}'}
