 "E2": "SCORE: 0.72\\n\\nREASON: The transparent admission of failure, concrete pricing restructuring, and commitment to publishing renewal/latency data demonstrates the operational rigor and accountability we require in mission-critical vendors, though the \\"lean rebuild\\" phase introduces execution risk that warrants deeper due diligence before committing to production workflows.", "E3": "SCORE: 0.72\\n\\nREASON: The transparent admission of failure, concrete pricing structure, and commitment to earning back trust through published data demonstrates the operational integrity and customer-centric accountability that enterprise partners require for long-term co-development relationships."}'}
